  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce ground beef",
    "1 medium yellow onion",
    "2 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1 teaspoon dried oregano",
    "1/4 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "1/2 teaspoon celery seed",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "6 cup green cabbage leaves",
    "10 ounce canned tomatoes with green chiles",
    "1/2 cup sour cream (for serving)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all ingredients. Dice the onion.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-cabbage-skillet/#wprm-recipe-53745-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Beef-Cabbage-Skillet-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan, add olive oil and yellow onion. Fry until the onion is translucent.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-cabbage-skillet/#wprm-recipe-53745-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Beef-Cabbage-Skillet-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, add in the ground beef with all of the seasonings. Cook the beef until brown.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-cabbage-skillet/#wprm-recipe-53745-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Beef-Cabbage-Skillet-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, add the cabbage leaves and canned tomatoes. Stir once in a while, but let simmer for about 25 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-cabbage-skillet/#wprm-recipe-53745-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Beef-Cabbage-Skillet-4.jpg"
    },
    {
